Project: BlackOpsARM

Goal
----
Native Android ARM64 port of the original T5 Zombies engine. Windows x64 is the
functional reference implementation; the original Win32 path remains a behavior
and serialization oracle. This Git worktree shares BlackOps64 history and sources.

Current Milestone
-----------------
Actual zone bootstrap gate complete (TASK-0009): twelve actual T5 units compile,
fifteen HONOR probes and MSVC x86/x64 regressions pass. Actual DB allocation and
stream initialization use real native named HunkUser/first-fit ownership with
preserved 36-byte XFile/four-byte slots. Windows production PMem/heap integration
and genuine decompressed XFile remain unvalidated. Next: TASK-0010 bounded
deflate isolation. See docs/port/arm64_zone.md; no full engine/game/backend work.

