size-limit failures on ARM64 and Win32/x64; genuine retail decode with hashes and
decoded header sizes when available; unchanged disk ABI; all fifteen current
device probes/host regressions green; archived failures and updated Ledger.
No asset parsing, async pipeline, full engine/backend work or further porting
started. Continue only with user direction; no current commit/push authorization.
docs/port/arm64_zone_changes.md and evidence/arm64_zone/preservation.json record
exact incremental changes and every currently modified/untracked durable file.
Ignored builds, binaries, SQLite, local.properties and scratch are retained.

